# Cesium Ion token is entered in the examples Settings gear and stored in
# localStorage (`tellux:cesium-ion-token`). It is not read from this file.
VITE_TIANDITU_TOKEN=your_tianditu_token
# Optional quantized-mesh URL. Used only when map-sources.config.ts
# localMapSourceProfile is 'cesiumUrl', or a profile's terrain is 'cesium-url'.
# VITE_CESIUM_TERRAIN_URL=https://example.com/terrain/
